    }
  ],
  "explanation": "The pipeline starts with a Builder drafting the full multi-market localization strategy. A Refiner then deepens country-specific nuance and ensures the shared technology core is properly balanced against local mandates and cultural factors. A While quality gate assesses the refined strategy against all regulatory, pedagogical, and procurement requirements; if it fails, it loops back to the Refiner for up to three retries. Once the strategy passes, an EdTech Market Expert enriches it with specialized insights on regulation, local partnerships, and culturally adaptive design. Finally, a Polisher formats the enhanced strategy into an executive-ready document with clear sections and an implementation roadmap."
